{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"三月七","aliases":["小三月"],"summary":{"text":"星穹列车成员，失去过往，名字由长夜月赋予，随列车在诸界开拓，立志描绘自己的未来。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1413-6","quote":"就像『三月七』这个名字，别出心裁，又多么贴切。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-4","quote":"她救下漂流在银河的三月七，开拓之旅从此染上了小三月的活力色彩。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"星穹列车成员","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-4","quote":"开拓之旅从此染上了小三月的活力色彩"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"姬子","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"星穹列车的领航员，少女时发现搁浅列车，后燃烧自身时间修复拓星者，让列车飞向深空。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-2","quote":"她回想着自己发现的搁浅列车，继续勾勒那些启程远航的画面。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-3","quote":"她燃烧着自己的时间。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-3","quote":"开拓的愿力为「拓星者」画下了最后一笔。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"星穹列车领航员","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-3","quote":"拓星者"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"开拓者","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"星穹列车的无名客，与伙伴在多个世界开拓，在翁法罗斯以身入局，直面毁灭的命运。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-4","quote":"她与开拓者在空间站相遇"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1415-4","quote":"开拓者，不要悲伤，好吗？"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1414-4","quote":"开拓者以身入局，归还「岁月」的火种。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"无名客","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1510-4","quote":"无名客从来不是一个人的名字"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"丹恒","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"星穹列车护卫，持明后裔，在翁法罗斯背负世界生灵，宣示护卫开拓前路。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1414-4","quote":"护卫『开拓』前路之人！"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1414-4","quote":"他背负起一个世界的生灵，将血脉与翁法罗斯的大地熔铸。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"星穹列车护卫、持明后裔","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1414-4","quote":"持明后裔的身份"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"雪衣","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"十王司判官，机巧之身，负伤率极高，在追捕药王秘传逃犯时被重创仍将其制服。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-3","quote":"雪衣大人，你这幅身体已经没救了。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-5","quote":"血衣判官自犯人巨硕的躯体上缓缓站起。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"十王司判官","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-2","quote":"白衣如雪的判官"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"寒鸦","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"十王司判官，雪衣之妹，通过饮忘川酒读取业判，承担记忆消散的代价。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1215-2","quote":"她是十王司中的一名判官，代号「寒鸦」的判官。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1215-3","quote":"忘川之酒，一饮成空。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"十王司判官","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1215-2","quote":"代号「寒鸦」的判官"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"腾骁","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"前代罗浮将军，在与千面怪树倏忽的战斗中以自身为代价，让金色幻影贯入大地。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-4","quote":"身着重甲的魁伟男子如同流星般坠入战场，怒啸着冲向巨树"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-4","quote":"腾骁，这次你打算用什么杀死我？"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1210-5","quote":"《腾骁斩大蛇》"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"前代罗浮将军","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1210-5","quote":"前代罗浮将军腾骁"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"倏忽","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"生有千面的怪树，许诺真正的长生，被视为生命之神的使者，最终与腾骁决战。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-4","quote":"我乃倏忽，我乃万古。从我开始，尔等将获得真正的长生。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1213-4","quote":"生命之神的使者本尊"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"特征","value":"生有千面的怪树","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1214-4","quote":"生有千面的怪树"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"应星","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"短生种铸匠，曾成为朱明百冶，后加入星核猎手，为向悲剧的罪魁祸首复仇而将自己锻造成牢笼。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1507-2","quote":"短生种要选为朱明工匠之首，前所未有。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1507-4","quote":"应星，难道你真想与我玉石俱焚？！"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1507-4","quote":"如今，他要向悲剧的罪魁祸首复仇。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"铸匠、星核猎手","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1507-4","quote":"星核猎手为改写终末而存在"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"怀炎","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"朱明仙舟铸匠，在焰轮铸炼宫悲剧后救下云璃并收为弟子。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1221-3","quote":"云璃被及时赶来的怀炎救下，逃过一劫。她成为了怀炎的弟子"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1507-2","quote":"师兄弟们来过，焰轮八叶来过，怀炎来过"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"铸匠、云璃之师","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1221-3","quote":"她成为了怀炎的弟子"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"云璃","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"怀炎的弟子，能辨识剑声与人情，从工炼房带走未铸成的剑胚，并为其命名「老铁」。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1221-3","quote":"她成为了怀炎的弟子，那剑胚也被她一同带离。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1221-3","quote":"不如，就叫你『老铁』吧。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"铸剑学徒","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1221-3","quote":"怀炎的弟子"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"海瑟音","aliases":["海列屈拉"],"summary":{"text":"海妖公主与歌者，黑潮后登陆，琴化为双剑，后追随凯撒成为剑旗爵。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1410-2","quote":"海妖的公主雀跃地追逐着泡泡"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1410-3","quote":"旧日的琴已化为两把利剑"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1410-4","quote":"海瑟音，追随我，我会赐予你所求的一切。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1412-5","quote":"剑旗爵，你可曾想过"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"海妖、剑旗爵","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1412-5","quote":"剑旗爵"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"刻律德菈","aliases":[],"summary":{"text":"蓝发金血的少女，曾被贵族当作傀儡王女，后推翻摄政王成为许珀耳君主，晚年以探险家身份闻名。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1412-2","quote":"从此刻起，你就是王女『刻律德菈』。"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1412-3","quote":"火光中，她戴上了那顶属于帝王的冠冕"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1415-5","quote":"探险家刻律德菈，成为了近距离征服黑洞的第一人"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"许珀耳君主、探险家","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1412-3","quote":"属于帝王的冠冕"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
{"type":"CHAR","canonical_name":"白厄","aliases":["救世主"],"summary":{"text":"黄金裔之一，背负众人心愿踏上逐火之路，愿燃尽此身化作明日烈阳，被称为救世主。","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1408-9","quote":"男人刻下「白厄」的最后一笔——"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1408-9","quote":"那就让怒火燃尽此身，化作明日的烈阳！"},{"cite_id":"STRY-1408-10","quote":"他将为它取另外一个名字——「救世主」。"}]},"attributes":[{"key":"身份","value":"救世主、黄金裔","claim_type":"fact","confidence":"attested","citations":[{"cite_id":"STRY-1408-10","quote":"「救世主」"}]}],"source_volume":"characters"}
